# Final addressing plan

Generated by `make deliverables` from
[inventories/common/group_vars/all.yml](../inventories/common/group_vars/all.yml),
the plan both sites share. All LAN interfaces are `/{{ lan_prefix }}`; the default
gateway of every VM is its OPNsense LAN address; the VIP is never assigned
statically (Keepalived moves it).

| Component | Site A | Site B |
|---|---|---|
| LAN subnet | `{{ sites.a.lan_cidr }}` | `{{ sites.b.lan_cidr }}` |
| OPNsense LAN (gateway, DNS) | `{{ sites.a.lan_gateway }}` | `{{ sites.b.lan_gateway }}` |
| OPNsense WAN | `{{ sites.a.wan_ip }}/{{ wan_prefix }}` | `{{ sites.b.wan_ip }}/{{ wan_prefix }}` |
| WAN upstream gateway | `{{ sites.a.wan_host_ip }}` | `192.168.100.2` (two computers) / `192.168.100.1` (one computer) |
| VIP (Keepalived, VRRP id) | `{{ sites.a.vip }}` (id {{ sites.a.vrrp_router_id }}) | `{{ sites.b.vip }}` (id {{ sites.b.vrrp_router_id }}) |
| HAProxy 1 — MASTER | `10.0.2.5` | `10.15.15.10` |
| HAProxy 2 — BACKUP | `10.0.2.6` | `10.15.15.11` |
| Web server (Nginx) | `{{ sites.a.web_ip }}` | `{{ sites.b.web_ip }}` |
| Database (MySQL) | `{{ sites.a.db_ip }}` | `{{ sites.b.db_ip }}` |
| Hypervisor (management only) | `{{ sites.a.lan_host_ip }}` | `{{ sites.b.lan_host_ip }}` |

## Flows

| Flow | Path | Ports |
|---|---|---|
| Public web | client → OPNsense WAN (destination NAT) → VIP → HAProxy → Nginx → MySQL | TCP 80, 443 |
| Inter-site | LAN → OPNsense → IPsec ESP tunnel → peer OPNsense → peer LAN (no NAT) | WAN: UDP 500, UDP 4500, ESP |
| Management | hypervisor `.254` → VMs (SSH), OPNsense GUI on LAN only | TCP 22, 443 |

## IPsec parameters (identical on both firewalls)

| Phase | Setting | Value |
|---|---|---|
| 1 (IKE SA) | Version / auth | IKEv2, pre-shared key |
| 1 | Proposal | AES-256 / SHA-256 / DH group 14 (modp2048) |
| 1 | Lifetime | 28 800 s |
| 2 (CHILD SA) | Mode / protocol | tunnel, ESP |
| 2 | Proposal | AES-256-GCM (128-bit ICV), PFS DH group 14 |
| 2 | Lifetime | 3 600 s |
| 2 | Networks | `{{ sites.a.lan_cidr }}` ⇄ `{{ sites.b.lan_cidr }}` |
